# Aladdin's ledge grab (PlayerLedgeGrab, $81:D470) with a ledge tile not
# mirrored and his ACTOR_FLIP set ($81:D47B: no grab, on at
# PlayerAirLand), which no catch meets. On the first level, at a frame's
# end, TILE_MIRRORED ($001A) set to 0, his ACTOR_FLIP ($08F0) to 1 and his
# code to PlayerLedgeGrab's entry (the record's P, PC: $30, $D470), as
# the actor loop resumes it.
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
poke $00001A 00
poke $0008F0 01
poke $0008DD 30,70,D4
wait 30
